    <dc:title>
      <rdf:Alt>
        <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">To develop a Library Book Management System using Classes and Encapsulation in Java. The program stores book details using private data members and provides operations to add, issue, return, search, and display books through a menu-driven interface.</rdf:li>
        <rdf:li xml:lang="en-IN">To develop a Library Book Management System using Classes and Encapsulation in Java. The program stores book details using private data members and provides operations to add, issue, return, search, and display books through a menu-driven interface.</rdf:li>
